Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.66,0:00:06.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is Trigun.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.68,0:00:33.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,guitar solo
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.18,0:01:36.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A $700,000 double-dollar reward for the\Nescaped convicts of the Nebraska family.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.00,0:01:38.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is huge.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.88,0:01:40.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't waste your time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.54,0:01:42.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take that one down. But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.72,0:01:43.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because they were caught.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.04,0:01:44.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.16,0:01:48.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, it's only been five hours\Nsince the warrant was issued.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.42,0:01:49.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That has to be the record.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.06,0:01:52.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll be even more surprised\Nwhen you see who caught them.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.92,0:01:54.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The entire city of an April?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.96,0:01:55.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.87,0:02:01.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's true just like it says the\Nentire city probably jumped in that
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.08,0:02:05.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is a whole lot of divvying must be\Npopulated by a bunch of macho types
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.38,0:02:10.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,are you really sure about this
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.42,0:02:12.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,after all the entire town did try to
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.68,0:02:15.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,kill you and you are the one who\Nsingle-handedly defeated the Nebraska
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.98,0:02:18.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,family so why did you pass up\Nthe seven hundred thousand double
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.00,0:02:25.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dollars. Well, why not? Oh, a big pile\Nof money like that would just be a
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.96,0:02:30.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,nuisance to a careless drifter like\Nme and besides now I get to have
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.22,0:02:33.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,all the salmon sandwiches I could\Npossibly eat isn't that right grams.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.82,0:02:35.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, darn tootin.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.34,0:02:37.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm kind of jealous
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.52,0:02:42.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You could have bought all the sandwich\Nfactories with money like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.10,0:02:42.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.46,0:02:46.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, then are you gentlemen\Nfinished with your talk?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.84,0:02:50.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why yes Then I would suggest that you\Nget away from him as soon as you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.90,0:02:53.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After all, this man is Bash the Stampede!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.80,0:02:56.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's dangerous, you\Nknow, isn't that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.80,0:02:57.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.88,0:02:58.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.04,0:03:01.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why did it have to be him?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.36,0:03:10.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Make way! Make way!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.92,0:03:11.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Step aside, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.00,0:03:15.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The infamous outlaw Bash the\NStampede is coming through!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.10,0:03:19.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's a wanted man with a bounty on his\Nhead for 60 billion double dollars!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.22,0:03:20.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Feared everywhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.13,0:03:22.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As the humanoid typhoon, watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.68,0:03:24.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because the legendary ace gunman!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.28,0:03:26.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Folks, if you come near\Nhim and he bites you,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.76,0:03:29.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,don't expect your insurance to cover it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.32,0:03:49.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, I was just wondering, how long\Nare you guys planning on hanging around?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.24,0:03:50.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, always, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.30,0:03:51.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vash.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.21,0:03:53.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see, as insurance\Nsociety representatives,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.22,0:03:54.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's our assignment to curb the damages.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.76,0:03:56.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,in the cases where you're involved.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.48,0:03:57.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't that right, Meryl?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.68,0:03:58.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.96,0:04:02.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just what in the hell do\Nyou have to be upset about?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.42,0:04:04.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you have any idea how much money the
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.52,0:04:06.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,society lost because of\Nthe crap you've pulled?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.68,0:04:07.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, now, stop that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.26,0:04:10.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I found you, Vash the Stampede!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.68,0:04:11.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a bounty hunter!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.56,0:04:15.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll have to do better than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.46,0:04:17.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right, I thought we were\Ngonna get you, Vash.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.68,0:04:20.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess I'm just lucky that\Nthese girls aren't too swift,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.44,0:04:22.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if you know what I'm saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.80,0:04:26.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I understand how you feel,\Nbut this is not the answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.42,0:04:28.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have to try to calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.50,0:04:35.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the sand steamer!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.92,0:04:43.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yahoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.83,0:04:45.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time to make some money!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.58,0:04:47.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, it's a humpback glass steamer.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.68,0:04:49.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh my gosh, that thing is gigantic.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.44,0:04:51.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never seen such a huge sand steamer!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.72,0:05:00.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's really incredible. I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.18,0:05:02.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Millie? Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.18,0:05:03.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where did Bash go?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.38,0:05:05.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.34,0:05:06.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you think we should do?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.66,0:05:07.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.50,0:05:09.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey, hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.50,0:05:10.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at this!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.41,0:05:11.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've never seen anything like it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.76,0:05:12.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Check this out!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.68,0:05:14.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the latest tasseled beagle!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.84,0:05:16.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How about this one?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.92,0:05:18.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you nuts?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.30,0:05:20.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're worth way more than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.56,0:05:25.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, mister, do you need\Nan extra hard worker today?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.34,0:05:28.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could use an extra pair\Nof hands, but not a kid's.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.48,0:05:31.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is like a big annual\Ncommunity festival.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.24,0:05:32.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The timing couldn't be better.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.06,0:05:36.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All of the plant engineers that we\Ncontacted arrived on the steamer,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.44,0:05:38.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and we have more than enough to pay them.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.22,0:05:41.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like my idea of calling in the\NNebraska family saved the day after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.04,0:05:44.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, right, but one false move\Nwould have meant utter disaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.98,0:05:45.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're no fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.34,0:05:47.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.36,0:05:50.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, there's a total babe on this ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.08,0:05:52.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She is so beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.72,0:06:03.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey, goddess girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.18,0:06:04.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you like to go out on a date, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.46,0:06:07.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, I'm the guy who's in\Ncharge of this fine city.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.10,0:06:09.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, don't be like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.50,0:06:12.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, come on, babe.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.68,0:06:13.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give me a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.59,0:06:16.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, don't you know I'm\Nsupersonic Sodom the Great? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.32,0:06:22.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perhaps it's better if you're\Nnot too familiar with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.48,0:06:25.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.04,0:06:56.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were just tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.68,0:06:59.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.54,0:07:05.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vash the Stampede.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.34,0:07:09.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Age unknown, origin unknown.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.88,0:07:11.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No permanent address.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.76,0:07:14.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wanted for the murder\Nof Count Lebnant Vazquez
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.08,0:07:17.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and under suspicion of\Nclass G weapon damage.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.58,0:07:21.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They will pay sixty billion double\Ndollars for you dead or alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.98,0:07:29.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know everything about you mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.38,0:07:32.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vash the Stampede that\Nmakes it so much easier.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.08,0:07:33.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's get married right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.30,0:07:34.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.58,0:07:38.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wonderful proposal you like that, huh,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.02,0:07:42.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I have you at a disadvantage\NYou don't know anything about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.44,0:07:43.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aren't you curious a little?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.88,0:07:44.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.79,0:07:49.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I already can tell a lot about you\NYou happen to be a woman who by chance
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.26,0:07:54.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,had her heart stolen by a stoic peace-loving\Ngunman In a word a pretty fairy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.14,0:07:58.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My name is Elizabeth I happen\Nto be the chief engineer
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.02,0:08:01.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of the Marius Breskin can\Ntackle technical industrial
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.68,0:08:05.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,union work dispatch team\NSo in short you're a fairy
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.28,0:08:08.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,like plant engineer then you\Nknow anything about plants.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.22,0:08:09.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr. Bash, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.32,0:08:13.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aren't they like lost technology from\Nover a hundred years ago or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.80,0:08:14.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.78,0:08:18.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They are systems which can achieve\Nproduction beyond all theoretical law.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.94,0:08:21.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They are the leftovers from\Nthe Pandora's box God gave
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.06,0:08:25.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,us that allow you and I to\Nexist in this poor environment.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.70,0:08:27.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I came to this place to repair the plant
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.02,0:08:30.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and to keep that hope\Nalive for these people.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.66,0:08:32.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then will you marry me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.06,0:08:36.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First, I have a special job\NI want you to do for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.12,0:08:37.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is there some kind of reward?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.20,0:08:40.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.14,0:08:41.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will give you what you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.64,0:08:44.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What I want? Really? Really? I'll do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.28,0:08:45.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.19,0:08:46.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll do whatever you want!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.66,0:08:52.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.82,0:08:54.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everything is dark cheap!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.54,0:08:56.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here's a piping hot one\Nfresh out of the oven!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.78,0:08:57.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, dude!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.69,0:08:58.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It smells delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.36,0:09:03.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For crying out loud,\Nwhere did that man go?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.10,0:09:06.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, all of these extra people\Nhere make it hard to find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.22,0:09:07.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That doesn't mean he'd be in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.00,0:09:08.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keep looking, Millie.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.96,0:09:09.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.87,0:09:11.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there, cute pie.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.34,0:09:14.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm ready and willing to be\Nyour obedient little doggy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.08,0:09:15.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I respond well to discipline.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.62,0:09:17.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice try, punk, but you're just a child.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.56,0:09:18.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.47,0:09:19.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.39,0:09:20.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She may not look it, but she's 20.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.30,0:09:21.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Millie, he doesn't need to know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.78,0:09:24.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'd advise against it anyway, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.16,0:09:25.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's really bitchy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.66,0:09:26.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.50,0:09:28.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr. Vash.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.36,0:09:30.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What? Vash?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.56,0:09:32.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where the hell have you been?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.98,0:09:33.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What have you...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.22,0:09:39.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who may I ask is that a total babe that is
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.30,0:09:41.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,not what I mean I asked him to serve as my
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.00,0:09:44.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,personal Bodyguard\Nwhile I'm here to revise
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.36,0:09:49.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the plant system program\NOh come along the spot
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.30,0:09:56.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Spa where's the hotel it's just\Nup ahead we're almost there
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.86,0:10:03.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Master, thank you. Well, we did find\Nhim. That is good, isn't it? Um, I'd...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.76,0:10:06.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,rather do a mountain of paperwork\Nthan watch over that idiot
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.44,0:10:12.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,for one more second I'm beginning
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.42,0:10:14.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the restoration work at 6 a .m.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.36,0:10:17.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,sharp so spot don't be late\Nnot to worry ma 'am in some
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.78,0:10:20.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,places I'm known as rooster\Nboy or early bird or even mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.84,0:10:25.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,up-and-at-um hey are we in the
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.84,0:10:28.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,same room as soon as my Work is done.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.16,0:10:31.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Spot until then, you are going\Nto sleep in the innermost room?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.18,0:10:32.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.09,0:10:38.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now it never seems to go my way. Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.12,0:10:41.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something's coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.68,0:10:58.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop there!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.82,0:11:01.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't like sleeping with\Nmen, especially ugly ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.66,0:11:04.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you please be good enough to go now?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.82,0:11:07.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He actually did what I asked him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.08,0:11:20.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, what happened here?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.44,0:11:21.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is horrible!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.58,0:11:23.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, hi, nothing to worry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.28,0:11:24.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go back to sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.22,0:11:26.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God, it's Vash's stampede!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.54,0:11:30.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm glad that I took the time to switch\Nour room numbers in the hotel registry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.64,0:11:31.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's no fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.02,0:11:33.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aren't you protecting me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.36,0:11:35.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd at least like to hear an explanation.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.76,0:11:36.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow will do.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.02,0:11:39.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I lost my room, so can I share yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.08,0:11:41.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you have a bed right out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.54,0:11:45.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's so cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.20,0:12:02.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure I'm glad you\NBernardelli people are here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.06,0:12:04.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here's my insurance policy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.52,0:12:08.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By the way, for our records,\Nwho was staying in this room?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.18,0:12:11.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't you tell by looking at the damage?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.44,0:12:13.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was Vasta Stampede, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.22,0:12:16.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, yeah, that guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.52,0:12:22.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There can only be one reason why\Nsomeone is trying to kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.10,0:12:25.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Most of what created the\Nplant was lost technology.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.34,0:12:27.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I have the knowledge to use it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.36,0:12:29.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But that doesn't necessarily mean that I
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.28,0:12:32.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,completely understand\Nwhat the plant really is.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.50,0:12:34.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, how have you\Nmanaged up to this point?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.80,0:12:38.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The union has always provided an escort\Nfor me in case there was any trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.52,0:12:41.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But this time, isn't it\Nwonderful you were here for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.32,0:12:43.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll do my best to live\Nup to your expectations.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.84,0:12:44.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.75,0:12:45.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't come in here!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.67,0:12:47.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This area's restricted!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.34,0:12:51.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I found out you're the one\Nresponsible for the hotel explosion.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.44,0:12:52.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, you found out wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.98,0:12:54.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was your fault, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.76,0:12:58.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The chief is gonna get mad at\Nus for not doing our job again.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.84,0:13:00.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I was the victim in all this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.28,0:13:02.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides, you're not\Nreally crying, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.00,0:13:07.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway, this plant is an important place,\Nand you are not allowed to be in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.98,0:13:09.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I really need him here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.84,0:13:12.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After all, Scott is guarding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.74,0:13:16.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, he may appear to be harmless,\Nbut he's bashed the stampede, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.80,0:13:18.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's exactly why I need him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.28,0:13:20.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But don't you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.74,0:13:24.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wherever this man goes, he\Nalways leaves trouble behind him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.54,0:13:27.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chief, there's a malfunction\Nin section number three.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.18,0:13:31.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gee, what amazing timing. No!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.66,0:13:36.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.86,0:13:40.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The production system in plant number\Nfour suddenly started operating.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.26,0:13:41.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut down the main control.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.90,0:13:43.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, ma 'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.81,0:13:44.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's no good.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.96,0:13:46.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not shutting down.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.18,0:13:47.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is really bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.46,0:13:50.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're going to have to send the\Nplant all the new data directly.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.32,0:13:51.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Spot? Yes! Come.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.54,0:13:54.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Coming! Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.16,0:13:55.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.58,0:13:56.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Try to understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.56,0:13:59.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if I have to shake you\Nfrom me, I've got to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.44,0:14:02.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's definitely something wrong with\Nthe dynamics of the situation here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.64,0:14:04.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think we'd better take shelter.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.56,0:14:07.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's trouble already\Nswarming after him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.28,0:14:15.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Flip the switch. Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.42,0:14:19.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right away. I'm on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.76,0:14:36.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.00,0:14:39.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't you run?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.08,0:14:51.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice warm-up. Now let's play.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.02,0:15:13.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't understand how you got in\Nhere, my vicious little friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.18,0:15:14.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a mystery to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.94,0:15:18.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're actually kind of cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.68,0:15:21.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess I'll have to get\Nsomeone better to beat you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.12,0:15:23.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks like I'll have to do it myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.64,0:15:33.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.55,0:15:34.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did you do that for?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.64,0:15:36.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Am I being punished for something?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.46,0:15:37.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want you dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.46,0:15:41.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, are you after that stupid reward? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.40,0:15:49.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want you to die for what you did on\NStardate 0104, July City, 2:06 p.m.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.92,0:15:51.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.20,0:15:53.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd think that you would\Nbecause that was the
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.10,0:15:55.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,day that you earned your\Nfirst criminal record.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.34,0:15:56.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.32,0:15:59.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That day you transformed the\Nthird city of July, my hometown,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.94,0:16:02.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,into nothing less than hell itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.44,0:16:08.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know what kind\Nof witchcraft you used.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.46,0:16:14.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The city was so badly destroyed,\Nand yet no one was killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.42,0:16:17.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But do you know what happened after?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.98,0:16:23.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One million four hundred thousand\Npeople became homeless and destitute.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.74,0:16:27.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Their bodies and souls\Nparched to the bone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.84,0:16:32.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They abused each other, stole from\Neach other, and despised one another.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.00,0:16:33.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.12,0:16:38.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,because of you I was thrown into\Nhell, but I still had to go on living.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.68,0:16:41.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mommy! Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.80,0:16:43.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why aren't you moving?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.14,0:16:56.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I remember it like it was yesterday,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.30,0:17:00.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,wandering through the rubble of what\Nused to be a city at the age of three.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.32,0:17:23.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want you to experience the\Nsame pain and sadness I felt.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.56,0:17:24.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's your turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.82,0:17:29.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now is the time to avenge\Nmy mother and father.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.14,0:17:31.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Repent.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.76,0:17:34.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Repent and die!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.04,0:17:37.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bash the stampede!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.64,0:17:46.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The same thing I can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.86,0:17:53.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's no good. The power\Nlevels aren't dropping.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.34,0:17:56.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we don't control it, in a few\Nhours it'll trigger an overflow,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.48,0:17:57.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then meltdown time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.78,0:17:59.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fire has erupted and spread\Ninto the Animus class.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.76,0:18:04.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If it explodes it'll leave a crater\N200 yards wide I input the new data.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.12,0:18:06.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How are the power?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.62,0:18:09.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone evacuate the facility quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.90,0:18:10.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, ma 'am
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.02,0:18:17.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He decided to stay behind. That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.14,0:18:22.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's decided to stay out of it, but it's\Nnot necessary for him to stay behind
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.40,0:18:24.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna go get him back.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.72,0:18:25.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No don't go in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.98,0:18:29.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's too late better get out\Nquickly or you'll be killed
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.30,0:18:41.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The plant disactivated.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.78,0:18:45.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn, did that woman leave me here to\Ndie with that A and bash the stampede?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.26,0:18:46.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That wasn't our deal!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.28,0:19:22.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe this is happening, and it\Nwas so hard to get the funds to repair it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.94,0:19:23.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.10,0:19:25.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But Max is still in there, Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.34,0:19:32.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, we better be...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.86,0:19:34.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.14,0:19:35.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.70,0:19:42.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The levels are dropping.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.08,0:19:42.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But how did that happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.99,0:19:44.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How should I know?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.10,0:19:46.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.44,0:19:47.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It couldn't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.62,0:20:01.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right! Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.70,0:20:04.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vash! Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.50,0:20:05.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.64,0:20:06.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.55,0:20:07.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vash is alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.47,0:20:09.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He stopped the plan from\Nexploding, and he saved us all!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.04,0:20:11.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, y-yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.28,0:20:13.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Mr. Vash!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.28,0:20:14.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice going, Vash!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.28,0:20:15.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're welcome to take\Ncare of this town, old man!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.04,0:20:16.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Vash!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.98,0:20:23.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aren't you gonna go see him?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.52,0:20:26.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He just likes to scare people.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.16,0:20:26.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's so bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.46,0:20:30.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, Millie, let's go\Norganize our paperwork.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.48,0:20:31.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.39,0:20:32.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Meryl! Wait up!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.22,0:20:41.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You... how?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.46,0:20:46.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm very sorry that I didn't die.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.92,0:20:51.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just couldn't allow everyone\Nin the city to be destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.04,0:20:54.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How dare you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.12,0:20:57.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How dare you say that after what you did?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.76,0:21:01.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you had succeeded in\Ndestroying the plant,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.04,0:21:03.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then you would have been the same as me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.64,0:21:07.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know that, but you're the last\Nperson I want to hear that from.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.58,0:21:10.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You destroyed July, you're\Nnothing but a hypocrite!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.14,0:21:14.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have no memory of any of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.12,0:21:19.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That ruined city,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.70,0:21:24.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,with all the piles of debris, were the\Nfirst and last things I saw of that place.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.26,0:21:25.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.76,0:21:30.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't remember anything before that,\Nexcept for memories of my early childhood.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.96,0:21:34.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're telling me it wasn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.26,0:21:36.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.00,0:21:39.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't know?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.96,0:21:42.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then just let me blame you for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.28,0:21:43.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me have my revenge!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.38,0:21:48.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Way to go, Mr. Bash!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.64,0:21:49.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The city is safe!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.26,0:21:55.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why did it have to be you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.44,0:22:00.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why did someone like you have to\Nturn out to be Bash the Stampede?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.94,0:22:05.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.38,0:22:13.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It couldn't be the same then.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.30,0:22:19.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This can't be happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.40,0:22:21.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was you all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.22,0:22:31.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That can't be, that can't be, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.64,0:23:37.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.04,0:23:39.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you
